er_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"world-model","other_summary":"先无监督学会环境如何随动作变化，再在该模型里训练策略。","rationale":"两者都预测下一步的压缩表示。世界模型以动作为条件，才能在假想轨迹里比较不同动作，而不是只续写已发生的序列。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"World Models","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.10122"}],"type":"analogous_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-21T06:09:22.496044+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eh885e3fk3am0n","other_id":"n_01m5eh84ssq64c612e","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"GPT-3","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"gpt-3","other_summary":"OpenAI 于 2020 年发布的 1750 亿参数自回归语言模型。","rationale":"GPT-3 以下一个词预测作为唯一的预训练目标。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Language Models are Few-Shot Learners","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.14165"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.85,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:56:28.283937+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5eqcbjz09akbe6v","other_id":"n_01m5eqcbch8tna0cg0","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Generative Verifier","other_name_zh":"生成式验证器","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"generative-verifier","other_summary":"用下一个词预测训练验证器、让它以生成文字的方式判断解答对错的方法。","rationale":"以下一个词预测目标训练验证器。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Generative Verifiers: Reward Modeling as Next-Token Prediction","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.15240"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.450922+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5gp43kjqak9mr10","other_id":"n_01m5gp43gktpjx7z7s","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"PaLM-E","other_name_zh":"具身多模态语言模型","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"palm-e","other_summary":"把图像和本体状态插进语言模型，并输出文字决策的模型。","rationale":"它是解码器语言模型，按下一个词预测生成文字形式的计划或回答。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"PaLM-E: An Embodied Multimodal Language Model","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.03378"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.9,"created_at"